{"about_the_game":"A darker fairy tale: this time, the setting is much darker than in previous games.<br><br>GAME FEATURES<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>With over 35 CGs and pin-up images, one of the biggest Winter Wolves games yet!<br></li><li>Play as the dark elf Amber in a dating/crafting simulation in a dark/gothic world<br></li><li>Three otome romances (Daniel, Bernard &amp; Lair), one yuri romance (Ruby)<br></li><li>And for the first time, two poly romances (Cosmina and Lynn)<br></li><li>Shop builder minigame: build your own &quot;magic shop&quot;!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/extras/f8a367bf1ef154a33e4c7e5b551db4ed.poster.avif?t=1684509048\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/extras/f8a367bf1ef154a33e4c7e5b551db4ed.webm?t=1684509048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/extras/f8a367bf1ef154a33e4c7e5b551db4ed.mp4?t=1684509048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Study and discover new recipes</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/extras/0b709b0d1d70046f5c0a260d6a4235fd.poster.avif?t=1684509048\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/extras/0b709b0d1d70046f5c0a260d6a4235fd.webm?t=1684509048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/extras/0b709b0d1d70046f5c0a260d6a4235fd.mp4?t=1684509048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Gather ingredients</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/extras/734386918ac3c790710365b2b295e3c0.poster.avif?t=1684509048\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/extras/734386918ac3c790710365b2b295e3c0.webm?t=1684509048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/extras/734386918ac3c790710365b2b295e3c0.mp4?t=1684509048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Craft to earn money and experience</i><br><br>Amber, a dark elf, was abandoned as baby in the woods south of Icesilia. She was found and raised by Vin, a witch, who decided she should become an alchemist. When Amber turned sixteen, Vin sent her to Icesilia as apprentice to the legendary mage Haros.<br><br>In the big town of Icesilia, she'll train and once she reachs adult age, become a master alchemist running her own shop, and along the way also meet interesting characters who might become something more than just friends:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Daniel, Haros' son, who wants to be a mage like his father but also trains in alchemy. In competition with Amber since young age, he'll need to be careful to not be consumed by his pride.<br></li><li>Bernard, a brave young man who wants to become a famous adventurer. Paranoid and ill-tempered, he'll need to learn to control himself to avoid doing things he might regret.<br></li><li>Lair, the son of the influent noble elf Arnor. Na\u00efve but with good heart, suffers the bad influence of his arrogant father Arnor.<br></li><li>Ruby, a seductive young woman who turned vampire just recently, struggling to not lose the humanity still left in her.<br></li><li>Cosa and Anders, two mysterious silver-haired adventurers who will ask Amber's help, and might reveal themselves to be something more than they look.<br></li><li>Lynn, a cute elf who runs the herbalist shop with her mother. A marriage with a noble has been arranged for her, but she's not sure if she really wants it.</li></ul><br>The game can be played as a dating sim and offers an optional crafting/simulation game. Each choice will change Amber's (and her friends/love interests) alignment: there's Dark and Light. But be careful: dark and light doesn't mean wrong or right. There are no right or wrong choices in this game, though some endings are more sad and cruel than others!<br><br>The game features 4 different endings for each love interest, with some dark events/scenes never seen before in a Winterwolves' game. Play the game at your own risk! Unlock all the endings of a specific character to discover bonus pin-up images.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"bab1cd116f97313817992213298f56810b24f638.jpg","localized_name":"Time Waits for No One","name":"Time Waits for No One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/bab1cd116f97313817992213298f56810b24f638.jpg"},{"icon":"e4c8b01811894e624cb666652def11323af91017.jpg","localized_name":"For the World's Sake","name":"For the World's Sake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/e4c8b01811894e624cb666652def11323af91017.jpg"},{"icon":"0e0ed1d02316075fe07f8e04d4261cad1068296d.jpg","localized_name":"Life at a Price","name":"Life at a Price","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/0e0ed1d02316075fe07f8e04d4261cad1068296d.jpg"},{"icon":"dea53784cd10b74310f7d2df5bd30a0531c16146.jpg","localized_name":"Greatest Mage in Aravorn","name":"Greatest Mage in Aravorn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/dea53784cd10b74310f7d2df5bd30a0531c16146.jpg"},{"icon":"fdf26598058a4058fadba014ca4656d8201cc17b.jpg","localized_name":"A Happy Mistake","name":"A Happy Mistake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/fdf26598058a4058fadba014ca4656d8201cc17b.jpg"},{"icon":"8315a139197f23e5c09e4ba0b3061f8c6f24c576.jpg","localized_name":"Not a Monster","name":"Not a Monster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/8315a139197f23e5c09e4ba0b3061f8c6f24c576.jpg"},{"icon":"6f03f498fa87bb3f0075182d02d3d4d3a4d8d41f.jpg","localized_name":"Beware Unintended Consequences","name":"Beware Unintended Consequences","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/6f03f498fa87bb3f0075182d02d3d4d3a4d8d41f.jpg"},{"icon":"d6d164fbe39049074318ab06bac5be2e527c984f.jpg","localized_name":"Price of Paranoia","name":"Price of Paranoia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/d6d164fbe39049074318ab06bac5be2e527c984f.jpg"},{"icon":"a2d2947dae58484e2c6c909d5c8c34c5d71d06a6.jpg","localized_name":"Purification","name":"Purification","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/a2d2947dae58484e2c6c909d5c8c34c5d71d06a6.jpg"},{"icon":"33ff2552dfde670fc4e64b996fc61131f05d2b08.jpg","localized_name":"Joy from Tragedy","name":"Joy from Tragedy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/584940/33ff2552dfde670fc4e64b996fc61131f05d2b08.jpg"}],"total":42},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/584940?t=1684509048","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/584940?t=1684509048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1684509048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1684509048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":